  subtitleText: "The neighbors of [BEEP] are shaken by the brutal murder of [BEEP],
    the beloved daughter of the [BEEP] family. The incident, though details remain
    uncharted, recounts: first the killer's approach and then his subsequent escape.
    The stabbing was repeated until she lay lifeless and there was no more left to
    count. A true tragedy\u2026"
